# Runtime Verification Required (P0 BLOCKING)

RULE: Never claim "done" or "it works" without running the code, waiting 8-10s, reading terminal output, and grepping for errors.
WHY: Claiming success without verification wastes user time; incident 2026-02-21.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/README.md

DO:
  Run code (npm run dev, uvicorn, python script)
  Wait 8-10s, read terminal, grep -i "error\|failed\|exception"
  Verify success message (ready, startup complete)

NEVER:
  "The code compiles, so it works"
  "Process started, so it works"
  Claim success without checking terminal output
